\newlabel{fig:results_shell_potential}{{4.13}{45}{\textbf {Shell contributions to the central potential depth.} Individual shells (blue points with error bars) contribute to the total potential depth $|\Phi (0)|$. The cumulative contribution (orange line) from all shells beyond a given radius shows that shells at radii beyond the scale radius $r_s$ still make substantial contributions to the escape-speed scale}{figure.caption.25}{}}
